<urn:atm:triage:finding/AXPE-RBQ-003>
  a triage:Finding ;
  triage:findingId "AXPE-RBQ-003" ;
  triage:title "MessageWriteOrigin peer provenance re-decided at three sites instead of one resolved fact" ;
  triage:description "Peer provenance is independently re-decided at three sites (write/pipeline.rs has_authenticated_peer_provenance and two raw .is_some() shortcuts in send/async_persistence.rs:201,286) instead of consuming the single ValidatedWriteProvenance computed in prepare_send_context. Masked today because the upstream gate rejects the one malformed combination; a provenance-rule change would desync the async sites silently. Remediation: thread the resolved provenance value through and delete the re-derivations. Deferred to the phase post-mortem follow-ups (non-blocking)." ;
